{"count": 142, "results": [{"listing_id": 1652594659, "title": "Navaris Elevated Pet Bowls Feeder - Triple Dog Cat Food Bowl Feeding Station - Metal Stand with 3 Stoneware Dishes - for Cats, Dogs, Pets - Dark Gray", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/1652594659", "category": "Dinnerware Set", "taxonomy_id": 1003, "price": {"amount": 3566, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Navaris", "description": "Feed your pet in comfort and style with the Navaris Stoneware Pet Bowls with Metal Stand. Featuring 3 removable dishes in a raised holder, you can provide food and water for one or more cats or dogs.\nEAT MORE COMFORTABLY\nThe elevated pet bowl design is great for cats or dogs to reduce bending their necks and shoulders while eating. They are also great for excitable messy pets who tend to knock ove"}, {"listing_id": 2378684495, "title": "Stone Lain Logan 12 Pieces Stoneware Dinnerware Set, Black", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/2378684495", "category": "Dinnerware Set", "taxonomy_id": 1003, "price": {"amount": 4798, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Stone Lain", "description": "Stone + Lain Logan in black is a 12 piece stoneware dinnerware set. The round dishes are practical for your everyday use but elegant to serve to you family and friends. The Logan is a service for 4, which includes 10.6\" dinner plates, 8.6\" salad plates and 5.9\" bowls. Every piece is microwave and dishwasher safe; re-heat your favorite meal for a fast and convenient solution and put the piece in th"}, {"listing_id": 894454889, "title": "Blue Rose Polish Pottery Atlas 16 Piece Dinnerware Set", "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/894454889", "category": "Dinnerware Set", "taxonomy_id": 1003, "price": {"amount": 52800, "divisor": 100, "currency_code": "USD"}, "shop_name": "Blue Rose Pottery", "description": "SAVE 20% when you purchase our 16 Piece Dinner Set - includes 4 Dinner Plates, 4 Dessert Plates, 4 Cereal/Soup Bowls and 4 Coffee Mugs - all si